#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:1
msgid "LoRa 移动站连接"
msgstr "Connecting a LoRa Rover"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:6
msgid ""
"在专用 D13 LoRa 基站完成架设后，连接 **D20 或 D13 移动站**并验证 RTK 固定解。"
"HM-D20-LoRa 和 HM-D13-LoRa 均按包含基站及配件的套件交付。"
msgstr ""
"After the dedicated D13 LoRa base station is set up, connect **D20 or D13 "
"rovers** and verify the RTK fixed solution. Both HM-D20-LoRa and HM-D13-LoRa "
"are delivered as kits including the base station and accessories."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:9
msgid "准备工作"
msgstr "Before You Begin"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:11
msgid "D20 LoRa 或 D13 LoRa 移动站。"
msgstr "D20 LoRa or D13 LoRa rover."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:12
msgid "套件内的专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件及配件。"
msgstr "Dedicated D13 LoRa base station hardware and accessories in the kit."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:13
msgid "D20 移动站和 D13 基站使用的 LoRa 天线；D13 移动站天线内置。"
msgstr ""
"LoRa antennas used by the D20 rover and the D13 base station; the D13 rover "
"antenna is built-in."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:14
msgid "基站供电设备，例如充电宝或 5 V ±0.5 V 电源。"
msgstr ""
"Base station power supply equipment, such as a power bank or a 5 V ±0.5 V "
"power supply."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:15
msgid "用于接收移动站串口数据的飞控、主控或 PC。"
msgstr ""
"For receiving serial data from the rover, the flight controller, main "
"controller, or PC."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:17
msgid "基站前提"
msgstr "Base station requirements"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:19
msgid ""
"专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件随套件提供，不单独销售，也不作为移动站使用。基站和移动"
"站出厂默认配对，上电自动连接。开始连接移动站前，先完成[LoRa 基站架设](d13-"
"base-station.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The dedicated D13 LoRa base station hardware is provided with the kit, not "
"sold separately, and is not used as a rover. The base station and rover are "
"paired by default at the factory and automatically connect when powered on. "
"Before starting to connect the rover, first complete the [Setting Up the "
"LoRa Base Station](d13-base-station.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:22
msgid ""
"开始前确认 基站已经稳定架设并保持静止；同一区域只开启一个基站；移动站与基站使"
"用套件内的出厂配对组合。"
msgstr ""
"Before starting, confirm that the base station has been stably set up and "
"remains stationary; only one base station should be activated in the same "
"area; the rover and base station should use the factory-paired combination "
"from the kit."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:25
msgid "移动站连接"
msgstr "Mobile site connection"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:27
msgid ""
"使用 D20 移动站时，将 LoRa 天线安装到 SMA 接口；D13 移动站使用内置 LoRa 天"
"线。"
msgstr ""
"When using the D20 rover, install the LoRa antenna on the SMA interface; the "
"D13 rover uses a built-in LoRa antenna."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:28
msgid ""
"按[D20 接口](../operation/d20-wiring.md)或[D13 接口](../operation/d13-wiring."
"md)连接移动站供电和 UART。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the rover power supply and UART according to the [D20 interface](../"
"operation/d20-wiring.md) or [D13 interface](../operation/d13-wiring.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:29
msgid "确认 D13 基站已上电并保持静止。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm that the D13 base station is powered on and remains stationary."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:30
msgid "确认移动站与基站之间尽量无遮挡或弱遮挡。"
msgstr ""
"Ensure that there is minimal or weak obstruction between the rover and the "
"base station."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:31
msgid "在上位机或目标设备中确认移动站持续输出与固件匹配的定位数据。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm in the host PC or target device that the rover continuously outputs "
"positioning data that matches the firmware."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:32
msgid "等待移动站自动接收差分数据并进入固定解。"
msgstr ""
"Wait for the rover to automatically receive correction data and enter a "
"fixed solution."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:34
msgid "状态验证"
msgstr "Status Verification"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:36
msgid ""
"按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)检查移动站的定"
"位输出和解状态。"
msgstr ""
"Follow [Checking RTK Status and the Fixed Solution](../operation/rtk-fixed-"
"validation.md) to verify rover output and solution status."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:38
msgid ""
"若固定解不稳定，优先检查基站是否移动、移动站天线、基站供电、LoRa 链路遮挡和天"
"空视野。"
msgstr ""
"If the fixed solution is unstable, first check whether the base station is "
"moving, the rover antenna, the base station power supply, LoRa link "
"blockage, and the sky view."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:40
msgid "LoRa 差分链路完成判据"
msgstr "LoRa correction link success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/lora.md:43
msgid "移动站定位数据持续输出，并在开阔环境进入 **RTK 固定解**。"
msgstr ""
"The rover outputs positioning data continuously and reaches an **RTK fixed "
"solution** with an open sky view."
